markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Practice

Now it’s your turn to explore how AI is being used across different industries while practicing your own prompting skills.

### Step 1: Choose a Large Language Model.
👉 Click one of the tools below to open it in a new tab. If your school or district uses a specific AI tool, we recommend practicing with that platform.

<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:stretch;width:95%;margin:20pt auto;gap:14px;">

  <!-- ChatGPT -->
  <div style="width:23%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9DDE3;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
    <a href="https://chatgpt.com/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
      <img src="https://images.code.org/c22ec02e808ca32157566d9fb91efbe0-Screenshot%202026-01-29%20at%2011.40.54%20AM.png" alt="ChatGPT Logo" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto !important;max-height:70px;object-fit:contain;">
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Gemini -->
  <div style="width:23%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9DDE3;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
    <a href="https://gemini.google.com/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
      <img src="https://images.code.org/c2897744ec844dadc387c770574cbefb-Screenshot%202026-01-29%20at%2011.39.33%20AM.png" alt="Gemini Logo" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto !important;max-height:70px;object-fit:contain;">
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Claude -->
  <div style="width:23%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9DDE3;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
    <a href="https://claude.ai/login" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
      <img src="https://images.code.org/4ac56eafff87360544c03cc012c9bd4a-Screenshot%202026-01-29%20at%2011.40.17%20AM.png" alt="Claude Logo" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto !important;max-height:70px;object-fit:contain;">
      <div style="font-size:12px;color:#777;margin-top:8px;">Account required</div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Copilot -->
  <div style="width:23%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9DDE3;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
