      <img src="https://images.code.org/bbfada5f0e117d70f873c77c7271e7eb-images.jpg" alt="Copilot Logo" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto !important;max-height:70px;object-fit:contain;">
    </a>
  </div>

</div>

### Step 2: Choose your role.

👉 Click to reveal exploration ideas and example prompts.

<details style="background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-right: 0%; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;">
    <summary style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;">Content Area Teachers</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px; padding-bottom:20px;">
    <p>

**Prompt the AI to learn more about how AI is influencing career pathways connected to your subject.**

For example, if you teach biology, you may choose to learn about the latest in AI technology in biomedical fields.

<div style="width:90%; margin:0 auto 18px auto;">
  <div style="background:#F7F8FA; border-left:5px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:14px; padding:18px;">
    <div style="font-size:16px;">
      ✨ <strong>Example Prompt</strong><br><br>How is AI currently being used in careers related to [your subject area], and what skills will students need in the future?
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</p></div>
</details>


<details style="background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-right: 0%; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;">
    <summary style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;">Elementary Teachers</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px; padding-bottom:20px;">
    <p>

**Prompt the AI to learn more about how AI is impacting the development of young students.**

For example, you could learn more about how access to voice assisted AI technology (like Siri) is impacting communication skills in pre-K.

<div style="width:90%; margin:0 auto 18px auto;">
  <div style="background:#F7F8FA; border-left:5px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:14px; padding:18px;">
    <div style="font-size:16px;">
      ✨ <strong>Example Prompt</strong><br><br>How might AI tools like voice assistants or chatbots impact communication, learning, or social development in young students?
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


 
</p></div>
</details>

<details style="background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-right: 0%; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;">
    <summary style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;">Administrators</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px; padding-bottom:20px;">
    <p>

**Prompt the AI to learn more about how AI is affecting administrative and leadership tasks.**

For example, you could learn how AI can be used for developing goals and growth plans or in data-informed decision making (attendance, scheduling, intervention planning).

<div style="width:90%; margin:0 auto 18px auto;">
  <div style="background:#F7F8FA; border-left:5px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:14px; padding:18px;">
    <div style="font-size:16px;">
      ✨ <strong>Example Prompt</strong><br><br>How is AI being used to support school leadership, scheduling, communication, or data-informed decision-making?
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


</p></div>
</details>

<details style="background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-right: 0%; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;">
    <summary style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;">Wildcard (Anyone)</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px; padding-bottom:20px;">
    <p>

**Prompt the AI to learn more about how AI is affecting a field you’re interested in.**

For example, if you’re curious about dinosaurs you could prompt about how AI has been affecting paleontology, and what tensions or tradeoffs does AI use create in that field.

<div style="width:90%; margin:0 auto 18px auto;">
  <div style="background:#F7F8FA; border-left:5px solid #8C52BA; border-radius:14px; padding:18px;">
    <div style="font-size:16px;">
      ✨ <strong>Example Prompt</strong><br><br>How is AI changing the field of [topic/industry], and what are some potential benefits and risks?
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


</p></div>
</details>

### Step 3: Explore and Refine

As you explore, use these strategies to improve and refine your prompting:

