<strong style="color:#222;">Ask follow-up questions</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:16px; color:#666;">
Dig deeper for more refined and helpful answers.
</span>
</td>
</tr>

<!-- ROW 2 -->
<tr style="background:white; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius:20px;">
<td style="width:86px; padding:10px 8px 10px 16px; text-align:center; border-radius:20px 0 0 20px;">
<img src="https://images.code.org/2e8846f6c855964dcb586f01c915d823-Screenshot 2026-05-28 at 1.02.44 PM.png" alt="Checklist clipboard with pencil and stars" style="width:58px; height:58px; object-fit:contain; display:block; margin:auto;">
</td>
<td style="width:62px; text-align:center;">
<div style="width:42px; height:42px; line-height:42px; margin:auto; background:#16b4c7; color:white; border-radius:50%; font-size:21px; font-weight:bold; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(22,180,199,0.35);">
2
</div>
</td>
<td style="padding:12px 20px 12px 6px; font-size:19px; line-height:1.1; border-radius:0 20px 20px 0;">
<strong style="color:#222;">Be specific</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:16px; color:#666;">
Clear details lead to better, more accurate responses.
</span>
</td>
</tr>

<!-- ROW 3 -->
<tr style="background:white; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius:20px;">
