</td>
<td style="width:62px; text-align:center;">
<div style="width:42px; height:42px; line-height:42px; margin:auto; background:#16b4c7; color:white; border-radius:50%; font-size:21px; font-weight:bold; box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(22,180,199,0.35);">
3
</div>
</td>
<td style="padding:12px 20px 12px 6px; font-size:19px; line-height:1.1; border-radius:0 20px 20px 0;">
<strong style="color:#222;">Use feedback</strong><br>
<span style="font-size:16px; color:#666;">
Guide and refine the AI until it gets closer to what you want.
</span>
</td>
</tr>

<!-- ROW 4 -->
<tr style="background:white; box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius:20px;">
